  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b4cc639a088c2722789f521d8654dffcebce8723e33f056d46a41263cd3a2839.png] \n\nChecking each option one by one:\n\n**Given equation:** 1496 × 8 + 13 - 40 ÷ 5 = 0\n\n1) ÷ and +\n\n1496 × 8 ÷ 13 - 40 + 5\n\nAccording to BODMAS rule;\n\n= 1496 × 0.615 - 40 + 5\n\n= 920.04 - 40 + 5 \n\n= 925.01 - 40\n\n**= 885.01 ≠ 0**\n\n2) × and +\n\n1496 + 8 × 13 - 40 ÷ 5\n\nAccording to BODMAS rule;\n\n= 1496 + 8 × 13 - 8\n\n= 1496 + 104 - 8\n\n= 1600 - 8\n\n**= 1592 ≠ 0**\n\n3) - and +\n\n1496 × 8 - 13 + 40 ÷ 5\n\nAccording to BODMAS rule;\n\n= 1496 × 8 - 13 + 8\n\n= 11968 - 13 + 8\n\n= 11976 - 13\n\n**= 11963 ≠ 0**\n\n**4)** **× and ÷**\n\n**1496 ÷ 8 + 13 - 40 × 5**\n\n**According to BODMAS rule-**\n\n**= 187 + 13 - 40 × 5**\n\n**= 187 + 13 - 200**\n\n**= 200 - 200**\n\n**= 0**\n\nHence, **Option (4)** is the answer",
